flint
=====

The component API, the registry shape and the "copy the source into your app"
model are inspired by shadcn/ui (https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui), MIT,
Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn.

No source file from shadcn/ui is copied into this repository: the components are
written for GPUIX, which has no DOM, no CSS and no Tailwind. Only the naming of
the variants and the public prop shapes follow the original.

